==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - template:
      inline: "\n<div>{{.content}}</div>\n        "
      values:
        content:
          - type: html
          - value: <p>SOME HTML CONTENT</p>
==== explainer ====
Template configurations for rendering the hypermedia. See <TEMPLATE> for field descriptions.
